      },
      "worked": "The tangent gradient is $m=\\tan45^\\circ=1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=2x+4\\\\2x+4&=1\\\\x&=-\\frac32.\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\left(-\\frac32\\right)^2+4\\left(-\\frac32\\right)+3\\\\y&=-\\frac34.\\end{align*}$$\n\nUsing point–gradient form at $\\left(-\\frac32,-\\frac34\\right)$,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y+\\frac34&=1\\left(x+\\frac32\\right)\\\\y&=x+\\frac34.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
